flowchart LR
    %% Planned architecture for the applied-AI evolution of PawPal+
    %% Solid arrows carry application data; dashed arrows are observability/test paths.

    User[Pet owner]

    subgraph App[Streamlit application]
        UI[Task planner and Ask PawPal interface]
        Context[Task context builder]
        Scheduler[Existing scheduling engine]
        Guardrails[Input validation and safety guardrails]
        AI[AI response service]
    end

    subgraph Knowledge[RAG knowledge layer]
        Retriever[Retriever]
        Notes[(Curated pet-care notes)]
    end

    subgraph External[Model provider]
        Model[LLM API]
    end

    subgraph Quality[Safety and reliability]
        Logs[(Application logs)]
        Tests[Automated scheduler and AI-pipeline tests]
    end

    User --> UI
    UI --> Scheduler
    Scheduler --> Context
    UI --> Guardrails
    Guardrails --> Context
    Context --> Retriever
    Retriever <--> Notes
    Retriever --> AI
    Context --> AI
    AI <--> Model
    AI --> UI
    Guardrails -. records events .-> Logs
    AI -. records model failures and sources .-> Logs
    Tests -. verifies .-> Scheduler
    Tests -. verifies retrieval, guardrails, and failures .-> AI
